  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **Added `ReuDataTable`** with sortable columns, paging, and on-demand loading through `ItemsProvider`\n- **Added `ReuHexEditor`**, a virtualized hex editor that edits a `byte[]` in place\n- **Added `ReuSplitPane`** with a handle resizable by mouse or keyboard\n- **Added `ReuDialogService` and `ReuDialogHost`** to confirm with a modal instead of the browser's `confirm`\n  - `ReuObjectTree` now asks before removing an element or setting a member to null\n- **Added `ReuReconnectModal`** to replace the `ReconnectModal` of the .NET 10 Blazor Web App template\n- Added `ReuThemeToggle`, a lightbulb button that switches between the light and dark theme\n- Upload components: Added `Streamed` and `OnStream` to open large files as seekable `ReuBrowserFileStream`s\n- Upload components: Added `Directory` to pick a folder and `Paste` to upload files pasted on the page\n- `ReuUploadButton` now renders as a `<label class=\"reu-button\">` instead of a `ReuButton`\n- Improved accessibility\n  - `ReuModal` makes the rest of the page inert while open and gives the focus back when closed\n  - `ReuTabs` closes a tab with Delete\n  - Upload components show keyboard focus and have accessible names\n  - `ReuObjectTree` value inputs have accessible names\n- Renamed the `--color-footer-bg` CSS variable to `--color-surface-secondary`, keeping the old name as a deprecated alias\n- Component styles and scripts are now minified in the package\n- Smaller text in `ReuLogs` and minor style fixes in `ReuFileBrowser`",
